# 메모리(같은 순간 GPU 측정): 4K 이미지를 열고 1:1로 바꿨다 맞춤으로 돌아와 닫는 한 바퀴를 4번 되풀이하며, 매 단계에서 `gpumem`(앱 안에서 같은 순간에 읽은 Private와 DXGI 그래픽 메모리)과 `mem`(바깥 실행기 표본)을 함께 남긴다.
# 기준 exe는 `gpumem`을 몰라 무시한다(`mem` 줄만 남는다). 임시 홈에 prep-big.sh로 proj-big 폴더를 채우고 기본 셸을 PowerShell로 둬야 한다. 실행 이름은 memory-gpu다.
waittabs 1 @30000
waitstate cwd=C: @30000
send echo READY-GPU\r
waitline READY-GPU @30000
wait 25000
mem before-open
gpumem before-open
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-gpu/proj-big/g-4k.png
waitstate kind=image state=image @20000
wait 4000
mem c1-fit
gpumem c1-fit
act imgzoom
waitstate full=yes @20000
gpumem c1-full-now
wait 4000
mem c1-full
gpumem c1-full
act imgzoom
waitstate full=no @5000
wait 4000
mem c1-back-to-fit
gpumem c1-back-to-fit
act closefile
wait 600
wait 600
wait 3000
mem c1-closed-4s
gpumem c1-closed-4s
wait 15000
mem c1-closed-34s
gpumem c1-closed-34s
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-gpu/proj-big/g-4k.png
waitstate kind=image state=image @20000
wait 4000
mem c2-fit
gpumem c2-fit
act imgzoom
waitstate full=yes @20000
gpumem c2-full-now
wait 4000
mem c2-full
gpumem c2-full
act imgzoom
waitstate full=no @5000
wait 4000
mem c2-back-to-fit
gpumem c2-back-to-fit
act closefile
wait 600
wait 600
wait 3000
mem c2-closed-4s
gpumem c2-closed-4s
wait 15000
mem c2-closed-34s
gpumem c2-closed-34s
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-gpu/proj-big/g-4k.png
waitstate kind=image state=image @20000
wait 4000
mem c3-fit
gpumem c3-fit
act imgzoom
waitstate full=yes @20000
gpumem c3-full-now
wait 4000
mem c3-full
gpumem c3-full
act imgzoom
waitstate full=no @5000
wait 4000
mem c3-back-to-fit
gpumem c3-back-to-fit
act closefile
wait 600
wait 600
wait 3000
mem c3-closed-4s
gpumem c3-closed-4s
wait 15000
mem c3-closed-34s
gpumem c3-closed-34s
act openpath C:/Temp/pdk-run/home-memory-gpu/proj-big/g-4k.png
waitstate kind=image state=image @20000
wait 4000
mem c4-fit
gpumem c4-fit
act imgzoom
waitstate full=yes @20000
gpumem c4-full-now
wait 4000
mem c4-full
gpumem c4-full
act imgzoom
waitstate full=no @5000
wait 4000
mem c4-back-to-fit
gpumem c4-back-to-fit
act closefile
wait 600
wait 600
wait 3000
mem c4-closed-4s
gpumem c4-closed-4s
wait 15000
mem c4-closed-34s
gpumem c4-closed-34s
quit
